[32m+[m[32m## 2. CALCULATION METHODOLOGY[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Data Sources[m
[32m+[m[32m1. **DATEV Payroll Files** (`2016*.csv`, `2017*.csv`)[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Contains actual paid salaries (gesamtkosten) for each person-month[m
[32m+[m[32m   - This is the authoritative source for personnel costs[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m2. **TKS Time Tracking Database**[m
[32m+[m[32m   - `dwt_worktime`: Actual booked hours per work day (in seconds)[m
[32m+[m[32m   - `nww_worktime_seconds`: Actual per-work-package allocation (in seconds)[m
[32m+[m[32m   - These fields contain the hours as entered by employees in the TKS system[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Calculation Steps[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Step 1: Calculate Monthly Personnel Cost**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mMonthly_Cost = SUM(gesamtkosten) from DATEV for person-month[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Step 2: Calculate Monthly Hourly Rate**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mHourly_Rate = Monthly_Cost / Total_Hours_Worked_That_Month[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mWhere `Total_Hours_Worked_That_Month` includes all work (not just ROBIN).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Step 3: Extract ROBIN Project Hours (CORRECTED METHOD)**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mROBIN_Hours = dwt_worktime (from TKS database)[m
[32m+[m[32m              where project = "ROBIN"[m
[32m+[m[32m              for each work package entry[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m**CRITICAL:** We use the `dwt_worktime` field directly (actual booked hours), NOT derived from timestamps.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Step 4: Apply Per-Work-Package Allocation (CORRECTED METHOD)**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mAllocated_Hours = nww_worktime_seconds / 3600[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32m**CRITICAL:** We use the actual per-WP allocation from `nww_worktime_seconds`, NOT equal splitting.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Step 5: Calculate ROBIN Project Cost**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mProject_Cost = Hourly_Rate × Allocated_ROBIN_Hours (summed across all months)[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Step 6: Sum Across 18-Month Period**[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m[32mTotal_Cost = SUM(Project_Cost) for March 2024 - August 2025[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Important Notes on Methodology[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Absences & Parental Leave:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- For non-HEU projects like ROBIN, absences are automatically reflected in the time tracking[m
[32m+[m[32m- If someone is on parental leave, they book 0 hours → 0 cost[m
[32m+[m[32m- No manual deduction needed (unlike HEU daily rate calculations)[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Hourly Rate Calculation:**[m
[32m+[m[32m- Based on TOTAL hours worked in a month (all projects)[m
[32m+[m[32m- Reflects the true cost per productive hour for that person-month[m
[32m+[m[32m- Accounts for all employer costs (salary, social charges, benefits, etc.)[m
